# Paths a pull request from outside the project may not change.
#
# Read from main by .github/workflows/protected-paths.yml, never from the pull
# request: a pull request cannot edit this list to let itself through. This
# file is itself protected.
#
# One pattern per line. `**` crosses folders, `*` stays within one name, and a
# pattern without a slash matches a file name in any folder. Lines starting
# with `@` name the accounts allowed to change these paths.
#
# scripts/check-protected-paths.mjs also guards fields of every package.json:
# identity, install-time scripts and dependencies. Changing a dependency, even
# its version, or a lockfile needs a maintainer's approval.

